  "notes": "QSFP-DD type 2a; coherent tunable DWDM. Nominal wavelengths stated as 191.3–196.1 THz on 6.25 GHz grid (not nm). Operating temp footnote: cold start from -5°C; specs after self-heating to min +15°C. Power consumption footnote: doubling default CD range adds 0.6 W. Tx power: min 1 dBm without attenuation; 10 dB attenuation range from max available; default max if not provisioned. Overview states output power 0 dBm for ROADM use vs GENERIC min Tx 1 dBm. Rx_LOS assert -28 dBm set for 400G modes (footnote 4). Absolute max: Rx signal +13 dBm, Rx total +15 dBm. Rx sens and Rx @ OSNR columns assume OSNR > 36 dB where noted. CMIS application codes 6, 7, 8, 12 enhanced media side, not interoperable with OpenZR+ MSA. Latency: 400G CFEC 8 us, 400G oFEC 5 us, 300G oFEC 6 us, 200G oFEC 7 us, 100G oFEC 11 us.",
